<view class="page">
  <view class="hero-card">
    <text class="eyebrow">雇主端</text>
    <text class="page-title">发布任务</text>
    <text class="page-desc">填写任务信息后立即进入任务列表，老人端会同步看到新任务；当老人接单后，这里可以直接把任务操作为已完成。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="nav-strip nav-strip-four">
      <navigator url="/pages/employer/publish/index" class="nav-chip nav-chip-active">
        <text class="nav-chip-title">发布任务</text>
      </navigator>
      <navigator url="/pages/employer/tasks/index" class="nav-chip">
        <text class="nav-chip-title">任务管理</text>
      </navigator>
      <navigator url="/pages/employer/orders/index" class="nav-chip">
        <text class="nav-chip-title">订单管理</text>
      </navigator>
      <navigator url="/pages/employer/profile/index" class="nav-chip">
        <text class="nav-chip-title">雇主资料</text>
      </navigator>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="card form-card">
      <view class="input-group">
        <text class="input-label">任务标题</text>
        <input class="input" value="{{form.title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="请输入任务标题" />
      </view>
      <view class="input-group">
        <text class="input-label">任务类型</text>
        <input class="input" value="{{form.type}}" data-field="type" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="请输入任务类型" />
      </view>
      <view class="input-group">
        <text class="input-label">服务时间</text>
        <input class="input" value="{{form.timeText}}" data-field="timeText" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="请输入服务时间" />
      </view>
      <view class="input-group">
        <text class="input-label">任务地址</text>
        <input class="input" value="{{form.address}}" data-field="address" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="请输入任务地址" />
      </view>
      <view class="input-group">
        <text class="input-label">报酬金额</text>
        <input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.salary}}" data-field="salary" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="请输入报酬金额" />
      </view>
      <view class="input-group">
        <text class="input-label">任务说明</text>
        <textarea class="textarea" value="{{form.content}}" data-field="content" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="请输入任务说明"></textarea>
      </view>
      <button class="btn-primary btn-block" style="margin-top: 20rpx;" bindtap="submitTask">发布任务</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-head">
      <text class="section-title">发布说明</text>
      <text class="section-link">提交后同步到任务管理</text>
    </view>
    <view class="notice-card">
      <text class="notice-title">发布后的去向</text>
      <text class="notice-text">新任务会出现在老人端任务大厅，同时也会进入雇主端“任务管理”页面。老人接单后，再去“订单管理”里完成任务并展示模拟结算。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
